        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We use hydraulic ramp trailers equipped with anti‑vibration mounts, 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Every vehicle is inspected before loading, secured with wheel chocks, and covered by IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance, guaranteeing a zero‑scratch delivery.</p>
