        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for car transportation in Natham to major hubs?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit time varies by distance and traffic, but the 850 km route via National Highway Arterial Corridors usually takes 12‑14 hours. Real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor progress, and we provide estimated arrival windows in the car delivery status updates.</p>
