        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle live during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our fleet is fitted with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You receive instant car delivery status alerts via SMS or email, allowing you to watch the journey from Natham to the destination in real time.</p>
